r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\">48 Hours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 233.75pt; border: solid white 1.0pt; mso-border-themecolor: background1; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid white .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: background1; mso-border-alt: solid white .5pt; background: #5B9BD5; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\">Emergency Turn Around Time</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid white 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: background1; border-right: solid white 1.0pt; mso-border-right-themecolor: background1; mso-border-top-alt: solid white .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: background1; mso-border-left-alt: solid white .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: background1; mso-border-alt: solid white .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: background1; background: #BDD6EE; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\">12 Hours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>Additional Hours can be bought for 120 Dhs Per hour or 5 hours for 500 Dhs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>', '150.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'other'),
(71, 'Hardware', '<p>Description Goes Here</p>', '0.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 11, NULL, 'other'),
(72, 'Web hosting 2000', '<ul>\r\n<li>Web Hosting 2000 MB</li>\r\n<li>Bandwidth: 20,000 MB Per month</li>\r\n<li>Languages Support: PHP, Java</li>\r\n<li>Database: MYSQL (3 Databases)</li>\r\n<li>Number of Emails: 30</li>\r\n</ul>', '100.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(73, 'Tourism Website', '<p>Bespoke Website Design with Fully Responsive and SEO Friendly Coding</p>\r\n<p><strong>Admin Panel:</strong></p>\r\n<p>- Add/Edit Unlimited Pages, Picture Galleries and Videos<br />- Define Tours, Packages and Combo Deals<br />- Setup Unlimited Seasonal Prices, daily Prices or Stop Timings<br />- Manage Customers &amp; Their Orders<br /><br /><strong>Front End:</strong><br /><br />- Beautiful presentation of Tours, Packages and Deals<br />- User can select, buy and Schedule Tours<br />- User can make payment through Credit Card</p>\r\n<p><strong>General Features:</strong><br />- SEO Friendly<br />- Users Statistics<br />- Fully Responsive<br />- Multi-User &amp; Secure<br />- Blog Integration<br />- Unlimited Informational Pages<br /><br /></p>', '15000.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'other'),
(74, 'Web Hosting 20000', '<ul>\r\n<li>Web Hosting 20,000 MB</li>\r\n<li>Bandwidth: 200,000 MB Per month</li>\r\n<li>Languages Support: PHP, Java</li>\r\n<li>Database: MYSQL (Unlimited Databases)</li>\r\n<li>Number of Emails: Unlimited</li>\r\n</ul>', '250.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(75, 'Tourism Website', '<p>Contemporary and Sleek Design with HTML5 and jQuery<br /><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Fully Responsive and Mobile Ready<br />Fully Dynamic<br />Powerful Content Management System (CMS)<br />SEO Friendly</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Features:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Tours &amp; Packages<br /><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Unlimited Tours BY Destination City or Activity Type</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Tour Detail Page</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Image Gallery / Video Attached with each Tour</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Tour Guide<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Tour Rating System*</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Booking &amp; Management:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Powerful Booking Form with Date of Booking and Number of Persons</li>\r\n<li>Order Management / Shopping Cart Integration&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Payment Gateway Integration (Paypal, and One Local Gateway)</li>\r\n</ul>', '16500.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'other'),
(76, 'Digital Marketing Management', '<p>Complete One-Stop Digital Marketing Management</p>\r\n<p><strong>Monthly Meeting for </strong></p>\r\n<p>- Last Month Performance and Statics<br />- Strategy Discussion<br /><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- Plan approval for Next Month</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Search Engine Optimization</strong></p>\r\n<p>- 15-20 Keywords SEO Services</p>\r\n<p><strong>Social Media Maintenance:</strong></p>\r\n<p>- Facebook, Instagram &amp; LinkedIn<br />- 4 Social Media Brochure Designs and Sharing<br />- Engaging in Conversations<br />- Designing and Implementing&nbsp;Paid Campaigns &amp; Boosts</p>\r\n<p><strong>Pay Per Click Campaigns</strong></p>\r\n<p>- Management of PPC Campaigns<br />- Retargeting Campaigns</p>', '8500.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 'other'),
(77, 'SMS System & Relays', '<p><strong>SMS Online Control Panel</strong><br />- Send SMS from Your Own Control<br />- Multi-Lingual, Support Hindi and Arabic also<br />- Delivery reports<br />- Many Users Databases to choose from<br />- Easy to handle Unlimited Phone Books<br /><br /><strong>SMS Credits Per Thousand</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '120.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 'other'),
(78, 'GSuit Professional Account', '<p>GSuit Professional Account</p>', '229.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(79, 'Gsuite Standard Edition', '<p>Google Apps (G-suite) Standard Edition</p>\r\n<p>10 Users each with 15 GB Space</p>\r\n<p>Google Calendar, Docs, Drive and Many Other Apps Included</p>\r\n<p>Powerful Anti-Spam, Anti-Virus and Security</p>\r\n<p>Power fo Gmail Interface</p>\r\n<p>Space Upgrade Options*</p>\r\n<p>Premium DNS Configuration</p>\r\n<p>Old Emails Migration Service available*</p>', '1800.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'other'),
(80, 'GSuite Pro Edition ', '', '185.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(81, 'Office 365', '<p>Office 365</p>', '180.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(82, 'SSL', '<p>SSL (Secure Certificate Layer)</p>', '1500.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, 'other'),
(83, 'OS 365 Essentials', '<ul class=\"xs-pmg-mh-1010 xl-pmg-mh-0000 pmg-lspo pmg-ph-0500 pmg-list-style-disc pmg-custom-tooltip\">\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Business-class email hosting with 50 GB mailbox</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Custom email domain addresses (<span>name@ yourcompany .com</span>)</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Web versions of Outlook, Word, Excel, and PowerPoint (desktop versions of applications not included)</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">1 TB of OneDrive storage</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Use SharePoint to inform and engage with a company-wide intranet, and connect teams to content, expertise, and processes with team sites.</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Host unlimited HD video conferencing meetings for up to 250 people with Skype for<span class=\"pmg-display-ib\">Business&nbsp;<a id=\"pmg-tooltip-biz-ess-1\" class=\"mscom-link pmgCustomTooltip pmg-outline-black pmg-outline-3\" title=\"pmg-tooltip-biz-ess-1\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://products.office.com/en/compare-all-microsoft-office-products?tab=2#a\" target=\"_self\"><img class=\"mscom-image\" src=\"https://c.s-microsoft.com/en/CMSImages/Tooltip.png?version=1454d884-faf6-aef1-1d01-d045a53eaa22\" alt=\"Tooltip about Skype for Business compatibility\" /></a></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Chat-based workspace to connect your teams with Microsoft Teams</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Manage tasks and teamwork with Microsoft Planner</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Collaborate across departments and locations with Yammer</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">Maximum number of users: 300</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">FastTrack deployment support with purchase of 50+ seats at no extra cost</li>\r\n<li class=\"pmg-pv-0010\">24/7 phone and web support</li>\r\n<li>Licensed for commercial use</li>\r\n</ul>', '221.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'other'),
