(299, 176, 'invoice', 'Web Designing (CMS)', '<p>(CMS) Content Management System</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Admin can add/edit/remove text /pictures/services any time and can add unlimited number of pages. Unlimited access to the admin and it can be accessible from anywhere.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Corporate Look Title Page &amp; Attractive Theme Designing With Jquery Banners.<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Website will be User friendly for further assistance site map will be there too.<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Link with Face book, Twitter &amp; other social media sites.</li>\r\n<li>Social Media icons to make it fast and easy for the users to share any page to the social media websites.</li>\r\n<li>SEO Meta Tags<br /> Separate meta tags for each page to help in SEO.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>- <strong>Powerful CMS, Features Include</strong></p>\r\n<p>- Complete Structure will be developed as per the Sitemap provided</p>\r\n<p>- Easy Editing Text &amp; Pictures</p>\r\n<p>- Adding New Pages/sub Menus/Services</p>\r\n<p>- Deleting Existing Pages</p>\r\n<p>- Multi-User Secure Environment</p>\r\n<p>- Newsletter Subscription</p>\r\n<p>- Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</p>\r\n<p>- Dynamic Picture Gallery</p>\r\n<p>- SEO Friendly</p>\r\n<p>- Site Map</p>\r\n<p>- High class XHTM Standard based development allows future extendibility of features easy</p>\r\n<p>- CMS support Adding New features fast and easy</p>', '1.00', '12000.00', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 23, '', '0', 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other'),
