(1192, 724, 'invoice', 'Search Engine Optimization (SEO) - Business Starter Package', '<p>- Upload 10 key indexable phrases that you choose to market your business.<br>- Analyze your competition.<br>- Examine the structure and content of your Web site.<br>- Create and upload search-engine friendly meta data.<br>- Provide a comprehensive SEO analysis of your site.<br>- Deliver support to discuss the present and future of your Web site.<br>- Submit your site to up to 100 search engines and directories.<br>- Submission of Press Releases<br>- Submission of Articles to Web 2.0 Properties<br>- Google & Yahoo Site Maps Creation & Submission<br>- Both IN-Page and Off-Page SEO<br>- Competitor Analysis, and Regular steps to increase PR of Site<br>- Monitor traffic using the latest SEO technology.<br>- Site Map Submissions to Google/Yahoo/MSN<br>- Robot.txt Optimization<br>- Social Bookmarking<br>- Content Optimization</p>\r\n<p><strong>Monthly Web Audit</strong><br>- Competition Analysis & Re-Adjustment of On-Page Optimization<br>- Keyword Ranking Report<br>- Link Analysis Report<br>- Web Traffic Report</p>\r\n<p>Min. 1 Year Contract</p>', '1.00', '4500.00', NULL, NULL, '2015-04-18', '2015-07-21', '1', 0, NULL, NULL, 34, 'Quarterly', '0', 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other'),
