(1254, 769, 'invoice', 'Web Designing (CMS)', '<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Responsive Design &amp; Development </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optimized Display on All Devices</li>\r\n<li>Optimized Display on Tablet Devices</li>\r\n<li>Optimized User Experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Website Designing &amp; Development &nbsp;&nbsp;( CMS based Dynamic) (English)</strong></p>\r\n<p>The dynamic website will contain following features :</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Corporate Look Title Page &amp; Attractive Theme Designing With Jquery Banners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Website will be User friendly for further assistance site map will be there too.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Customized articles with image galleries. <br /> About Us</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Mission &amp; Vision<br /> History<br /> Chairman Message</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hotels<br /> All the hotels will be displayed &amp; separate page for each hotel providing information about it with image galleries &amp; room facilities. </li>\r\n<li>Accommodation / Rooms <br /> Separate page for each room with its detail &amp; image gallery. Also user can book room directly from its page.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offers<br /> Different offers will be shown in this section.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Image Gallery<br /> Different images will be displayed in an attractive way in form of albums.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Packages<br /> List of packages in this section with images &amp; inquiry option.</li>\r\n<li>News &amp; Events.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>To keep the user update with the latest news &amp; events coming up or any exciting offer. </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Video<br /> Video can be shown on any page or in form of a gallery.</li>\r\n<li>Newsletter Subscription<br /> User can subscribe to newsletter to get new offers. </li>\r\n<li>Contact Us With Feedback Form Plus Google Location Map.</li>\r\n<li>Link with Face book, Twitter &amp; other social media sites.</li>\r\n<li>Social Media icons to make it fast and easy for the users to share any page to the social media websites.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSEO Meta Tags<br /> Separate Meta tags for each page to help in SEO.</li>\r\n</ul>', '1.00', '4100.00', NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 23, 'Monthly', '0', 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other'),
