(2419, 1522, 'invoice', 'Chat Box', '<p>Web Based Live Chat ( FOR ONE YEAR )</p><br />\r\n<p>Single User ( operator )</p><br />\r\n<p>-  Just launch a web browser on any computer to begin providing live chat assistance.-  Embed or popup chat window-  Embed the chat window on your webpage or open a new window when the chat icon is clicked.-  Waiting Queue-  Place new chat requests in the \"Waiting Queue\" when department operator is chatting at their max concurrent chat session-  </p><br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">-  Operator profile picture</span></p><br />\r\n<p>-  Customize the profile picture and profile picture visibility setting for operator.-  Party \"is typing\" indicator-  Each party (visitor and operator) is notified when the other is typing a message.-  Faster than typing, create canned responses for quick answers to frequently asked questions.-  Maximum concurrent chat limit-  Set the maximum active chat session limit for operator.-  Operator initiated chat-  Operator can proactively send a chat request TO the visitor.-  Automatic chat invitation-  Idle chat automatic disconnect-  If a chat response is not sent within set minutes, automatically disconnect the chat.</p>', '1.00', '1500.00', '', 1, '1970-01-01', '1970-01-01', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 62, '', '0', 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other'),
