(5, 'Proposal for Web Design', '{proposal_items}', 1, '2017-11-07 13:48:31', '2000.00', '2000.00', '0.00', '0.00', NULL, '0.00', NULL, '0.00', '', '', 1, 1, '2017-11-14', '2017-11-07', 1360, 'lead', 1, 'df5fbb2416c211f9187136ffb4da26c8', 'Ortegos Delli', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pchan@thestrawgroup.ae', '0559472578', 0, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Dear Sir <br /><br />We gratefully acknowledge the opportunity given us, to discuss the possibility of providing our services for developing a Dynamic CMS based Website for your prestige Organization. We give hereunder the basic understandings about the requirements, Scope, and Terms &amp; Conditions', '<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul xss=\"removed\">\r\n<li>Payment Terms: 50% Advance, 50% on completion.</li>\r\n<li>No Design Changes</li>\r\n<li>Time Period: 7 Days.</li>\r\n<li>Please make Payment through Cross Check or Bank Transfer.</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(11, 'Quotation for A Dynamic Website', '{proposal_items}', 5, '2017-11-22 11:50:03', '6500.00', '6500.00', '0.00', '0.00', NULL, '0.00', NULL, '0.00', '', '', 1, 1, '2017-11-29', '2017-11-22', 1364, 'lead', 5, '2571fe8fe18b51d05e805df008ed9b02', 'New company', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'farrukh010185@gmail.com', '042246114', 0, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Dear Sir <br /><br />We gratefully acknowledge the opportunity given us, to discuss the possibility of providing our services for developing a Dynamic CMS based Website for your prestige Organization. We give hereunder the basic understandings about the requirements, Scope, and Terms &amp; Conditions', '<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul xss=\"removed\">\r\n<li>6-month free maintenance (Troubleshooting, Bug removal and free Email Support)</li>\r\n<li>Payment Terms: 50% advance, 50% on completion.</li>\r\n<li>Data Entry and Site maintenance shall be the responsibility of the client. However, Wisdom can provide the same on additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>Time Period: 4 weeks after Design approval.</li>\r\n<li>Please make Payment through Cross Check or Bank Transfer.</li>\r\n</ul>'),
