(1723, 'invoice', 1522, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_short_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:9:\"Chat Box \";i:1;s:8:\"Chat Box\";}', '23', 'Naseem Aslam', '2017-11-28 16:44:57'),
(1724, 'invoice', 1522, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1252:\"<p>Web Based Live Chat ( FOR ONE YEAR )</p>\r\n<p>Single User ( operator )</p>\r\n<p>-  Just launch a web browser on any computer to begin providing live chat assistance.<br />-  Embed or popup chat window<br />-  Embed the chat window on your webpage or open a new window when the chat icon is clicked.<br />-  Waiting Queue<br />-  Place new chat requests in the \"Waiting Queue\" when department operator is chatting at their max concurrent chat session-  </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">-  Operator profile picture</span></p>\r\n<p>-  Customize the profile picture and profile picture visibility setting for operator.<br />-  Party \"is typing\" indicator<br />-  Each party (visitor and operator) is notified when the other is typing a message.<br />-  Faster than typing, create canned responses for quick answers to frequently asked questions.<br />-  Maximum concurrent chat limit<br />-  Set the maximum active chat session limit for operator.<br />-  Operator initiated chat<br />-  Operator can proactively send a chat request TO the visitor.<br />-  Automatic chat invitation<br />-  Idle chat automatic disconnect<br />-  If a chat response is not sent within set minutes, automatically disconnect the chat.<br /><br /></p>\";i:1;s:1156:\"<p>Web Based Live Chat ( FOR ONE YEAR )</p>\r\n<p>Single User ( operator )</p>\r\n<p>-  Just launch a web browser on any computer to begin providing live chat assistance.-  Embed or popup chat window-  Embed the chat window on your webpage or open a new window when the chat icon is clicked.-  Waiting Queue-  Place new chat requests in the \"Waiting Queue\" when department operator is chatting at their max concurrent chat session-  </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">-  Operator profile picture</span></p>\r\n<p>-  Customize the profile picture and profile picture visibility setting for operator.-  Party \"is typing\" indicator-  Each party (visitor and operator) is notified when the other is typing a message.-  Faster than typing, create canned responses for quick answers to frequently asked questions.-  Maximum concurrent chat limit-  Set the maximum active chat session limit for operator.-  Operator initiated chat-  Operator can proactively send a chat request TO the visitor.-  Automatic chat invitation-  Idle chat automatic disconnect-  If a chat response is not sent within set minutes, automatically disconnect the chat.</p>\";}', '23', 'Naseem Aslam', '2017-11-28 16:44:57'),
