(1751, 'invoice', 1361, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1136:\"<ul>\r\n<li>Graphically Rich web Design With Jquery Banners (English)</li>\r\n<li>Powerful CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Add/Edit/Delete Unlimited Pages and add Unlimited Pictures</li>\r\n<li>Complete Structure will be developed as per the Sitemap provided</li>\r\n<li>Video Enabled </li>\r\n<li>Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Picture Gallery </li>\r\n<li>Social Media Sharing (Facebook Share, Like, Twitter, etc)</li>\r\n<li>SEO Friendly</li>\r\n<li>High class XHTM Standard based development allows future extendibility of features easy</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Browser compatibility</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Device Compatibility</li>\r\n<li>CMS support Adding New features fast and easy</li>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on All Phones</li>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on Tablet Devices</li>\r\n<li>Optimised User Experience</li>\r\n<li>Optimized Loading Speed for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Search Engine Optimised for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Manage the Same Code, Files and Administration for all Devices</li>\r\n<li>Linkage to Social Media Accounts</li>\r\n<li>Creation of Social Media Accounts / Basic ( facebook, LinkedIn, Instagram, twitter )</li>\r\n</ul>\";i:1;s:1136:\"<ul>\r\n<li>Graphically Rich web Design With Jquery Banners (English)</li>\r\n<li>Powerful CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Add/Edit/Delete Unlimited Pages and add Unlimited Pictures</li>\r\n<li>Complete Structure will be developed as per the Sitemap provided</li>\r\n<li>Video Enabled </li>\r\n<li>Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Picture Gallery </li>\r\n<li>Social Media Sharing (Facebook Share, Like, Twitter, etc)</li>\r\n<li>SEO Friendly</li>\r\n<li>High class XHTM Standard based development allows future extendibility of features easy</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Browser compatibility</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Device Compatibility</li>\r\n<li>CMS support Adding New features fast and easy</li>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on All Phones</li>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on Tablet Devices</li>\r\n<li>Optimised User Experience</li>\r\n<li>Optimized Loading Speed for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Search Engine Optimised for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Manage the Same Code, Files and Administration for all Devices</li>\r\n<li>Linkage to Social Media Accounts</li>\r\n<li>Creation of Social Media Accounts / Basic ( facebook, LinkedIn, Instagram, twitter )</li>\r\n</ul>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2017-12-04 14:43:14'),
