(1853, 'invoice', 1474, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:925:\"<ul>\r\n<li>Graphically Rich Web Design With Jquery Banners (English)</li>\r\n<li>Powerful CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Add/Edit/Delete Unlimited Pages and add Unlimited Pictures</li>\r\n<li>Complete Structure will be developed as per the Sitemap provided</li>\r\n<li>Video Enabled </li>\r\n<li>Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Picture Gallery </li>\r\n<li>Social Media Sharing (Facebook Share, Like, Twitter, etc)</li>\r\n<li>SEO Friendly</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Browser/Device compatibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Process:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A layout will be designed in the start. The customer can ask for unlimited revisions, till he is 100% satisfied.</li>\r\n<li>Once Design is finalized, Coding will be done. After Design finalization, No Change in Layout will be accepted. However, pictures can be changed.</li>\r\n<li>Customer will provide the data, which we will populate to CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Go Live</li>\r\n</ul>\";i:1;s:925:\"<ul>\r\n<li>Graphically Rich Web Design With Jquery Banners (English)</li>\r\n<li>Powerful CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Add/Edit/Delete Unlimited Pages and add Unlimited Pictures</li>\r\n<li>Complete Structure will be developed as per the Sitemap provided</li>\r\n<li>Video Enabled </li>\r\n<li>Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Picture Gallery </li>\r\n<li>Social Media Sharing (Facebook Share, Like, Twitter, etc)</li>\r\n<li>SEO Friendly</li>\r\n<li>Cross-Browser/Device compatibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Process:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A layout will be designed in the start. The customer can ask for unlimited revisions, till he is 100% satisfied.</li>\r\n<li>Once Design is finalized, Coding will be done. After Design finalization, No Change in Layout will be accepted. However, pictures can be changed.</li>\r\n<li>Customer will provide the data, which we will populate to CMS.</li>\r\n<li>Go Live</li>\r\n</ul>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2017-12-18 09:12:17'),
