(457, 'Tenant form not working properly', '<ol>\r\n<li>when filling form and creating contact it do not load the unit of selected property</li>\r\n<li>In payment details when cheque is selected it do not allow to update and it go to reset</li>\r\n</ol>', 2, '2018-05-02 17:13:00', '2018-05-02', NULL, '2018-05-05 15:43:19', 22, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 73, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 4, 0, 1, 0, 'work', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(458, 'Send a link to user for lease request', '<ol>\r\n<li>In backend give an option to admin in which it will select property and unit and link will be created and sent to the user</li>\r\n<li><g class=\"gr_ gr_158 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins doubleReplace replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"158\" data-gr-id=\"158\">user</g> will click on <g class=\"gr_ gr_159 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins doubleReplace replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"159\" data-gr-id=\"159\">link</g> and he will only see the selected property from admin</li>\r\n</ol>', 2, '2018-05-02 17:26:30', '2018-05-02', NULL, '2018-05-14 11:00:45', 22, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 73, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 3, 0, 1, 0, 'work', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
