(477, 'Company information changed - Accounts software', '<p>Kamran sb. ask to change the company information of Zuta to New company.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These changes done in database.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Fixed.</p>', 3, '2018-05-14 16:23:14', '2018-05-14', NULL, '2018-05-14 16:23:22', 27, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', '', 0, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(478, 'Update Email Templates from the system', 'Update the email templates provided by Mr. Shabbar in the&nbsp;email. Templates should be according the users roles', 3, '2018-05-15 11:01:48', '2018-05-15', NULL, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 22, 0, 4, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 73, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', 'Office', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(479, 'Backend - make two types of tenant (residential & commerical)', '<p>In Admin panel when admin creates a tenant it should be of two types:</p>\r\n<p>1- Residential<br />2- Commercial<br /><br />Update the tenant registration forms according to the type<br /><br /></p>', 2, '2018-05-15 11:03:48', '2018-05-15', NULL, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 22, 0, 4, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 73, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, '', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(480, 'Issue permits to tenant or staff from backend', 'Admin should be able to issue permits to tenants&nbsp;or its staff according to the request type. There are three types of the request currently<br /><br />\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Move-in request (for the tenant)</li>\r\n<li>move-out request&nbsp;(for the tenant)</li>\r\n<li>inspection permit&nbsp;(for staff)</li>\r\n</ol>', 2, '2018-05-15 11:06:56', '2018-05-15', NULL, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 22, 0, 4, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 73, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, '', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(481, 'Variants combination updated in Ecommerce', 'Variants combination updated in Ecommerce on the base of warehouse selected from the admin panel.', 2, '2018-05-15 18:47:37', '2018-05-15', NULL, '2018-05-15 18:47:40', 27, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', '', 0, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(482, 'Return Sale without Variant price', '<p>Item variant price not calculated on the return sale. even tax calculation also wrong on that page.</p>\r\n<p>*Its fixed.</p>', 4, '2018-05-15 18:49:03', '2018-05-15', NULL, '2018-05-15 18:49:07', 27, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', '', 0, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(483, 'On the Return sale quantity is not updated', '<p>On the POS sale return quantity is not returned.</p>\r\n<p>Fixed.</p>', 4, '2018-05-15 18:50:04', '2018-05-15', NULL, '2018-05-15 18:50:06', 27, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', '', 0, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
(484, 'University Book house Import products', '<p>For the university book house the import products section is ready with the base on Language &gt; Arabic/English.</p>\r\n<p>Multiple authors also fixed.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>CSV file is ready to import products.</p>', 4, '2018-05-15 18:51:44', '2018-05-15', NULL, '2018-05-15 18:51:45', 27, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '0.00', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'work', '', 0, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
